<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.1999 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 17		 July 16</p>
<p> High			     75.1500		 75.2000</p>
<p> Low				75.1000		 75.1700</p>
<p> Open			     75.1200		 75.2000</p>
<p> Close			    75.1500		 75.1999</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  7.295		   4.455</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
